  "details": "This Canny is related to the following Canny:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/client-freezes-with-string-loading\n\nIn  VRChat client [1622] Build (OpenBeta), the freezes on Binary file of StringLoading have disappeared. Thank you.\n\nHowever, the freeze problem still occurs on ClientSim of Unity Editor. This fix is ​​necessary to make development proceed smoothly, so please fix it in the same way as the VRChat client.\n\nI'm attaching the unitypackage of the world uploaded to the previous Canny to confirm the reproducibility with ClientSim. Please open the scene file.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1NroG9gO3iLURdGro8FFOKVbpZHRjeQHo/view?usp=sharing",
